{
  "entries": [
    {
      "offset": "0x221521",
      "back_en": "Dear brother, surely there is something we can do.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'sister' traduzido como 'irmão' (brother); gênero invertido."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x221582",
      "back_en": "drown them, poison them... Nothing works, so...",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'envená-los' é erro; correto 'envenená-los'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2215b5",
      "back_en": "Th-Then what the heck shall we do!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'que diabo' adiciona leve ênfase, sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x221798",
      "back_en": "Came up with one of your schemes, did you, dear?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Equivalente fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22192b",
      "back_en": "O-Ohhh! I see. I mean, of COURSE I already knew that",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x221a98",
      "back_en": "B-But will it work? There are more Tatari around",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x221c87",
      "back_en": "I place my life in your hands.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22280d",
      "back_en": "What a cold wind...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222844",
      "back_en": "I d-didn't think it would be this bad...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22286e",
      "back_en": "Glorioush triumph! The Tatari grows ever more",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'Gloriosho' parece gracejo/sotaque intencional; sentido ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22289c",
      "back_en": "frost-crackled with each convulsive movement!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'wanton lurch' como 'movimento convulso', aceitável."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2228f0",
      "back_en": "now?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22299a",
      "back_en": "little jellies!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2229f0",
      "back_en": "Eeeeek! We are undone! We are truly undone!!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222d06",
      "back_en": "Ha-ha-ha. So you have finally made it.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Estilo robótico hifenizado perdido na tradução."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222d3c",
      "back_en": "Not bad, huh.",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "Perde a fala robótica hifenizada do original."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222d7c",
      "back_en": "Wait a minute...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222d8d",
      "back_en": "Wh-What...!? An impostor!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x223935",
      "back_en": "Oho! The Tatari lies defeated before us!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22395e",
      "back_en": "Master Haku, thy brilliance is true to form!",
      "verdict": "revise",
      "note": "'brilhantia' não é palavra; usar 'brilho/brilhantismo'."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2239be",
      "back_en": "Aaahhh!?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Interjeição equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x223ffe",
      "back_en": "Could I... have ended up like that...?",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22404e",
      "back_en": "Haku is right here in front of me, as a person!",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2214f6",
      "back_en": "she just uses one of the flash bombs.",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fragmento equivalente."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x22162b",
      "back_en": "Hold on, those people inside the caskets...",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x2228f8",
      "back_en": "Dear sister, I would advise against getting too close",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "'drawing too near' como 'aproximar demais', ok."
    },
    {
      "offset": "0x222da8",
      "back_en": "Whoa. What a clever little trick they've got going,",
      "verdict": "pass",
      "note": "Fiel."
    }
  ],
